              "fill": "$muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "While a caption is playing: the ring around her pulses outward (scale 1 → 1.08, opacity 1 → 0) on a 1.6s loop, and the three dots in the caption header animate in sequence as a mouth-shape indicator. Ring and dots stop together when the line ends.",
